          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Double-Double configuration</span></span></p>\n<p>The Omega platform offers Double-Double implant kits for the 3.9mm and 4.75mm sizes. Ideal for cases requiring two implants, the Double-Double kits feature disposable instrumentation that is designed to be reloaded intraoperatively with a second set of implants. The Double-Double configurations can offer efficiency advantages with the Omega platform.<br>\n</p>\n",
